WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.010
The first card shows a vague request: Can
you check this soon?

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:11.445
The second card names the owner, action
and deadline: Lina, check the draft by
sixteen hundred U T C.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:18.575
The last card adds a next step: record the
outcome in the project log. Your team can
pick up the work later.
